        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a55",
          "question": "<p>In the following questions two equations numbered I and II are given. You have to solve both the equations and choose the correct option.<br />I.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />II.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>\\(x&lt;y\\)</p>",
            "<p>\\(x&gt;y\\)</p>",
            "<p>\\(x \\leq y\\)</p>",
            "<p>\\(x \\geq y\\)</p>",
            "<p>\\(x = y\\) or relationship cannot be established</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p>From equation I:<br />\\[<br />\\begin{aligned}<br />&amp; x^2-17 x-60=(x+3)(x-20)=0 \\\\<br />&amp; \\Rightarrow x=-3,20<br />\\end{aligned}<br />\\]<br />From equation II:<br />\\[<br />\\begin{aligned}<br />&amp; y^2+16 y+39=(y+3)(y+13) \\\\<br />&amp; =0 \\\\<br />&amp; \\Rightarrow&gt;y=-3,-13<br />\\end{aligned}<br />\\]</p>\n<p><img title=\"1111.png\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5b09189f7285894d9130ccd0/i6kt5xegkq1446ccf7e538cvz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"77\" /></p>\n<p>So, \\(x \\geq y\\)</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a56",
          "question": "<p>In the Given Questions Two Equation numbered I and II are given .You have to solve each equation and marks the appropriate answer:</p>\n<ol type=\"I\">\n<li>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\({2x}^{2} + 17x + 26 = 0\\)</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(2y^{2} + 17y + 36 = 0\\)</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ol>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(x &gt; y\\)</span></p>",
            "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(x &lt; y\\)</span></p>",
            "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(x \\geq y\\)</span></p>",
            "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(x \\leq y\\)</span></p>",
            "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(x = y\\)</span> or No Relationship can be establish</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 4,
          "explanation": "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\({2x}^{2} + 17x + 26 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\({2x}^{2} + 13x + 4x + 26 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\(2x(x + 2) + 13(x + 2) = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\((2x + 13)(x + 2) = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x = - 13/2\\ ,y = - 2\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(2y^{2} + 17y + 36 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\(2y^{2} + 9y + 8y + 36 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\(2y(y + 4) + 9(y + 4) = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\((2y + 9)(y + 4) = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>=&gt;<span class=\"math inline\">\\(y = - 9/2\\ ,\\ y = - 4\\)</span></p>\n<p>We can see clearly there is no relation between <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\ and\\ \\ y,\\)</span></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a57",
          "question": "<p><strong>Directions: In each question two equations numbered (1) and (2) are given. You should solve both the equations and mark appropriate answer.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>(1) </strong>x<sup>2</sup> + 19x + 90 = 0</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> y<sup>2</sup> &ndash; 23y + 130 = 0</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>if x &gt; y</p>",
            "<p>if x &ge; y</p>",
            "<p>if x &lt; y</p>",
            "<p>if x &le; y</p>",
            "<p>if x = y or the relationship cannot be established</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 2,
          "explanation": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>+19x +90 =0;</p>\n<p>x<sup>2</sup>+10x+9x+90=0 ;</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p>(x+9)(x+10)=0;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>x= -9,-10 ;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>y<sup>2</sup>-23y+130=0</p>\n<p>y<sup>2</sup>-10y-13y+130=0</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p>(y-10)(y-13)=0</p>\n<p>y=10, 13</p>\n<p>Hence y&gt;x</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a58",
          "question": "<p>In the questions, two equations I and II are given. You have to solve both the equations to establish the correct relation between x and y and choose the correct option.</p>\n<p>I.) x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 169</p>\n<p>II.) y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;&ndash; 24y + 144 = 0</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>x &gt; y</p>",
            "<p>x &lt; y</p>",
            "<p>x = y or the relationship cannot be established</p>",
            "<p>x &ge; y</p>",
            "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">x &le; y</span></p>"
          ],
          "correct": 2,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Solution</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From I:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;= 169</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">x = +13, -13</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From II:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;&ndash; 24y + 144 = 0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;&ndash; 12y &ndash; 12y + 144 = 0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">y(y &ndash; 12) &ndash; 12(y &ndash; 12) = 0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(y &ndash; 12)(y &ndash; 12) = 0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">y = 12, 12</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So, the relationship between &lsquo;x&rsquo; and &lsquo;y&rsquo; cannot be established.</span></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a59",
          "question": "<p>Following question contains two equations as I and II. You have to solve both equations and determine the relationship between them and give an answer.</p>\n<p>(i) 6x<sup>2</sup> + 14x + 8 = 0</p>\n<p>(ii) 3y<sup>2</sup> + 7y + 4 = 0</p>",
