          "explanation": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>19</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&ndash;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" rowlines=\"solid\" columnlines=\"solid\" frame=\"solid\"><mtr><mtd><mtext>&nbsp;Value of X&nbsp;</mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext>&nbsp;Value of&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mtd><mtd><mtext>&nbsp;Relation&nbsp;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>15</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>11</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>15</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>11</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>\n<p>Hence, Relation between x and y can&rsquo;t be determine here.</p>"
