        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a5f",
          "question": "<p><strong>Direction : In each of these questions, two equations 1 and 2 are given. You have to solve both the equations and give the answer.</strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(1.\\ x^{2} - 30x + 216\\&nbsp;&nbsp;= \\ 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\({2.y}^{2} - \\ 21y\\&nbsp;&nbsp;+ \\ 108\\&nbsp;&nbsp;= \\ 0\\)</span></p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<blockquote>\n<p>If x=y or no relation can be established between x and y</p>\n</blockquote>",
