            "<blockquote>\n<p>If x&gt;y</p>\n</blockquote>"
          ],
          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(1.\\ x^{2} - 30x + 216\\&nbsp;&nbsp;= \\ 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>216</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">x(x - 18) - 12(x - 18) = 0</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">x = 18 or 12</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\({2.y}^{2} - \\ 21y\\&nbsp;&nbsp;+ \\ 108\\&nbsp;&nbsp;= \\ 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">y(y - 12) -9(y - 12) = 0</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">y = 12 or 9&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>9 &lt; 12 &lt; 18</p>\n<p>x &ge; y</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a60",
          "question": "<p>Directions: In each of these questions, two equations (I) and (II) are given. You have to solve both the equations and give answers</p>\n<p>I. <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a^{2}\\)</span> + 6<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 9 = 0</p>\n<p>II. <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z^{2}\\)</span> &ndash; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 20 = 0</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
