            "<p>z &le; a</p>",
            "<p>z &ge; a</p>",
            "<p>z &lt; a</p>",
            "<p>z = a or relationship between z and a can't be established</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 4,
          "explanation": "<p>According to the given equations :</p>\n<p>I. <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a^{2}\\)</span> + 6<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 9 = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a^{2}\\)</span> + 3<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 3<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 9 = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 3) + 3 (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 3) = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 3) (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> + 3) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> = &ndash; 3, &ndash; 3</p>\n<p>II. <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z^{2}\\)</span> &ndash; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 20 = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z^{2}\\)</span> &ndash; 5<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> + 4<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 20 = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 5) + 4 (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 5) = 0</p>\n<p>&rArr; (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> + 4) (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> &ndash; 5) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> = &ndash; 4, 5</p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> = &ndash; 3 and <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> = &ndash; 4,</p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> &gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span></p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> = &ndash; 3 and <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span> = 5,</p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(a\\)</span> &lt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(z\\)</span></p>\n<p>Hence, no relationship can be established</p>"
        },
        {
