          "explanation": "<p>I: <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x^{2} + 8x - 105 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">x = - 15 or 7</span></p>\n<p>II: <span class=\"math inline\">\\(y^{2} - 15y + 56 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">y = 7 or 8</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">-15 &lt;7&lt;8</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">x &le; y</span></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a62",
          "question": "<p>Directions: In each of these questions, two equations (I) and (II) are given. You have to solve both the equations and give answers</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
