            "<p>w = x or relationship between w and x can't be established</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 4,
          "explanation": "<p>According to the given equations :</p>\n<p>I.</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(w^{2}\\)</span> + <span class=\"math inline\">\\(7w\\)</span> + 12 = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(w^{2}\\)</span> + 3<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 4<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 12 = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 3) + 4 (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 3) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 4) (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> + 3) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> = &ndash; 3,&ndash; 4</p>\n<p>II.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x^{2}\\)</span> + 3<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> &ndash; 4 = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x^{2}\\)</span> + 4<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> &ndash; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> &ndash; 4 = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> + 4) &ndash; 1 (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> + 4) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span>&ndash; 1) (<span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> + 4) = 0</p>\n<p>=&gt; <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> = 1, &ndash; 4</p>\n<p>After comparison of both equations, the conclusion is, <span class=\"math inline\">\\(w\\)</span> = <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x\\)</span> or no relation is obtained</p>"
        },
