          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a63",
          "question": "<p>In the following question, two equations I and II are given. Solve both the equations carefully and choose the correct option.</p>\n<p>I: <span class=\"math inline\">\\(x^{2} - 2x - 143 = 0\\)</span></p>\n<p>II: <span class=\"math inline\">\\(y^{2} - 18y - 243 = 0\\)</span></p>",
