            "<p>x = y or relationship between x and y cannot be determined</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 4,
          "explanation": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>143</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>143</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p>x(x-13)+11(x-13)=0</p>\n<p>(x+11)(x-13)=0</p>\n<p>x=-11,13</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>-18y-243=0</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>243</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p>y(y-27)+9(y-27)=0</p>\n<p>(y-27)(y+9)=0</p>\n<p>y=-9,27</p>\n<p>x = y or relationship between x and y cannot be determined</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
