        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a64",
          "question": "<p><strong>Following question contains two equations as I and II. You have to solve both equations and determine the relationship between them and give answer as,</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I)&nbsp;</strong>2x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 26x + 84 = 0</p>\n<p><strong>II)</strong>y<sup>2</sup>+ 15y + 56 = 0</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>x &gt; y</p>",
            "<p>x &ge; y</p>",
            "<p>x = y or relationship can&rsquo;t be determined.</p>",
            "<p>x &lt; y</p>",
            "<p>x &le; y</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explanation": "<p>2x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 26x + 84 = 0</p>\n<p>2x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 14x + 12x + 84 = 0</p>\n<p>2x(x + 7) + 12(x + 7) = 0</p>\n<p>(2x + 12)(x + 7) = 0</p>\n<p>x = -6, -7</p>\n<p>y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 15y + 56 = 0</p>\n<p>y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 8y + 7y + 56 = 0</p>\n<p>y(y + 8) + 7(y + 8) = 0</p>\n<p>(y + 7)(y + 8) = 0</p>\n<p>y = -7, -8</p>\n<p>x &ge; y</p>"
        },
